ion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}pointclass} \\vdash \\Pi^1_1(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n:\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus B)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}pointclass} \\vdash \\Pi^1_1(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n:\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus B)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R^n}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Pi^1_1(\\mathbb R^n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Coanalytic}_{\\mathbb R^n}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Pi^1_1(\\mathbb R^n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coanalytic sets are complements of analytic sets.</li>\n<li>Perfect-set consequences require additional hypotheses and are not part of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-analytic","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-analytic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-analytic","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-analytic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal P(